{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"No","category":"综合能源","country":"丹麦","country_iso":"DNK","created_at":"2026-03-23T11:19:50.805554","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"DNK-HB-0001","ldc":"No","location":"","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"丹麦4GWp光伏及储能项目","project_name_en":"Denmark 4GWp Solar PV and BESS Project","subcategory":"光储"},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"正泰新能源","content":"正泰新能源\n正泰新能源是正泰集团旗下集清洁能源开发、建设、运营、服务于一体的系统能源解决方案提供商，致力于光伏组件的生产和销售，并布局有光伏电站、储能、配网售电、微电网、多能互补等综合能源领域的投资建设。截至目前，公司在全球累计光伏装机容量达8GW。\nINTEC\nINTEC致力于为全球客户提供光伏整体解决方案和高效的EPC及运维服务。INTEC拥有经验丰富、技术纯熟的高技能人才团队。迄今，已在全球多个国家积累了130多个项目建设经验。\nBeGreen\nBeGreen主要布局丹麦、瑞典和波兰等国家，为当地开发、建造、运维大型光伏电站，并提供电力存储解决方案。BeGreen与市政当局、土地所有者、电网运营商和投资者合作，在无补贴的情况下建设太阳能电站，同时向消费者提供有吸引力的电价，并向投资者提供稳定的投资回报。BeGreen计划在2025年底前开发、建设和运营光伏电站4GWp。","content_sha256":"4d2d737683840ca8a77f6bc0220b70a0f3acffbaf9f60a3d1f8a6c1e5b2e7df7","id":17066,"publish_date":"2022-02-11 07:20:26","title":"正泰新能源携手INTEC开拓丹麦清洁能源市场","title_sha256":"a64398c1e4af55f5c1d14f44ff192980316490d45ee7b9a0a1fc51f6a7e72f14","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/25912.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"DNK-HB-0001","capacity_details":"PV: 4000MWp","capacity_mw":4000.0,"capacity_mw_raw":"4000","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T11:19:50.806131","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"DNK-HB-0001-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[]","official_website_links":"[\"https://energy.chint.com/news/detail/id/792.html\"]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"BeGreen","project_developer_en":"BeGreen","project_stage":"拟开发","project_summary":"正泰新能